From: XG2010G OpenWrt maintainers <xg2010g@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 13:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add EPON LLID QDMA data path

Keep EPON LLID/QDMA state separate from GPON and XGS-PON, map each
registered LLID index to the matching QDMA channel, and transactionally
manage GDM2/PSE resources. Drop EPON OAM until its dedicated consumer is
registered instead of passing IEEE 802.3ah frames to OMCI.

Signed-off-by: XG2010G OpenWrt maintainers <xg2010g@example.invalid>
